  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "52",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 52"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "52",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awake, awake; put on thy strength, O Zion; put on thy beautiful garments, O Jerusalem, the holy city: for henceforth there shall no more come into thee the uncircumcised and the unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shake thyself from the dust; arise,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sit down, O Jerusalem: loose thyself from the bands of thy neck, O captive daughter of Zion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Ye have sold yourselves for nought; and ye shall be redeemed without money.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus saith the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", My people went down aforetime into Egypt to sojourn there; and the Assyrian oppressed them without cause.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore, what have I here, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that my people is taken away for nought? they that rule over them make them to howl, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and my name continually every day",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blasphemed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore my people shall know my name: therefore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they shall know",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in that day that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that doth speak: behold,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ How beautiful upon the mountains are the feet of him that bringeth good tidings, that publisheth peace; that bringeth good tidings of good, that publisheth salvation; that saith unto Zion, Thy God reigneth!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy watchmen shall lift up the voice; with the voice together shall they sing: for they shall see eye to eye, when the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall bring again Zion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Break forth into joy, sing together, ye waste places of Jerusalem: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath comforted his people, he hath redeemed Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath made bare his holy arm in the eyes of all the nations; and all the ends of the earth shall see the salvation of our God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Depart ye, depart ye, go ye out from thence, touch no unclean",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thing;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "go ye out of the midst of her; be ye clean, that bear the vessels of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For ye shall not go out with haste, nor go by flight: for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will go before you; and the God of Israel",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "will be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your rereward.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Behold, my servant shall deal prudently, he shall be exalted and extolled, and be very high.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As many were astonied at thee; his visage was so marred more than any man, and his form more than the sons of men:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So shall he sprinkle many nations; the kings shall shut their mouths at him: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which had not been told them shall they see; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.52.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which they had not heard shall they consider.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
